FAKE_WARMUP_LINE="Index warm-up: read the upper levels of the spent key, transaction and block hash indexes, 3864 pages (15 MB), in 0.1 s. Their 198629 leaf pages (813 MB) were not read: more than 60% of the 1073 MB of memory" \
